rmc-xeno-evolution-failed-renegade = We have no Queen to answer to anymore. We cannot evolve into one.

rmc-xeno-renegade-tag-removed = With the removal of the device, your instincts have returned to normal.

rmc-xeno-renegade-defect-title = Alliance broken!
rmc-xeno-renegade-defect-message = Our Queen has broken the alliance with the { $faction }. The device inside our carapace begins to suppress our connection with the Hive. Do we remove it and follow the Queen?
rmc-xeno-renegade-defect-obey-queen = Obey the Queen
rmc-xeno-renegade-defect-obey-talls = Obey the talls
rmc-xeno-renegade-defect-timed-out = Offer expired.

rmc-xeno-renegade-defect-self = You lost the connection with your Hive. Now you have no Queen, only your masters.
rmc-xeno-renegade-defect-others = { $xeno } seems to have lost its connection to its Hive!
rmc-xeno-renegade-defect-announce = The advanced IFF Xenonid tagging technology has detected hostile intentions and successfully suppressed the psychic link of a lifeform. The collaborative lifeform is given designation Renegade. Full cooperation is to be expected.

rmc-xeno-renegade-stay-self = You rip the IFF tag out of your own carapace! For the Hive!
rmc-xeno-renegade-stay-others = { $xeno } rips out its IFF tag!
